desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "结构匹配：检测 Python Crypto DES.new"
	title_zh: "结构匹配：检测 Python Crypto DES.new"
	type: vuln
	level: "middle"
	rule_id: "source-python-pycrypto-des"
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 Crypto.Cipher.DES。DES 密钥过短。

### 风险类型
weak-cryptographic-algorithm

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用 AES-GCM。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://des.py": <<<POS
from Crypto.Cipher import DES
def enc(key, data):
    return DES.new(key, DES.MODE_ECB).encrypt(data)
POS
	"safefile://aes.py": <<<NEG
from Crypto.Cipher import AES
def enc(key, data):
    return AES.new(key, AES.MODE_GCM).encrypt(data)
NEG
)
DES.new(* as $key) as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "检测 Python Crypto DES.new",
	title_zh: "检测 Python Crypto DES.new",
	message: "检测 Python Crypto DES.new",
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm",
}
